<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes down in stagnant trading.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes down in stagnant trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>The Czech RPIX closes lower in very light trading.</p>
<p>*  down 6.3 points, 0.6 percent, to 1,046.5.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 4.1 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Skoda Plzen falls five crowns to 1,020. Most heavily traded share with turnover of one million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka loses 32 crowns to 1,977.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
